    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Whitelist happens here\nThis Code node builds brand new objects: name, email, time_off (start/end only, every absence labelled \"away\" so leave type never leaves n8n) and public_holidays. Nothing from the PeopleForce payload is spread or passed through — adding a field here is the only way to widen what internal teams see.",
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "03a4c5e3-ff3b-426e-b3f1-26634d8a7996",
      "name": "Sticky Note 41bea931",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        112,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auth\nHeader Auth credential on the webhook — set the header name and shared secret, and give each internal team the value. Optional query params: from, to (yyyy-MM-dd) and emails (comma-separated) to narrow the response.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1e75fd76-0c3b-4c5c-9cb2-20682a4e1a11",
